cal/partial JSON, blank/trailing garbage, seq breaks, prev_hash/logical_hash/record_hash mismatch, duplicate id, non-backward cause, or HEAD!=tip -- including hash-PERFECT forged chains (forward-cause-in-storage, re-hashed duplicate id, seq!=0). 40 fixture tests through the public seams; a worked fixture pins literal known hashes (logical d2238b62..., record a8579cee...) so hashing is not tautological. ZERO real forward events: default store ledger/h7_forward/ holds only README.md; events.jsonl and HEAD are ABSENT and prohibited until Stage 8 activation; the default verifier prints VALID EMPTY exit 0 and creates nothing. Independent agent review: PASS on all 11 audited points, ZERO substantive findings (five cosmetic; four fixed: short-write loop, precise docstring, tighter type hints, hash-perfect forgery regression tests). Verification true exit codes: unittest 842 OK exit0; ruff exit0; pyright exit0; pre-commit all-files exit0; git diff --check exit0. Protected: research anchored ledger OK trial_count 11; ledger/experiments.jsonl and ledger/HEAD byte-identical; shared market-data cache unchanged. No network, paid pull, trade decision, intent, approval, fill, forward event, P&L, historical result, or activation. Stage 3 BUILT but INACTIVE; Stages 4-8 remain unauthorized.
